Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 16:54:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 74/77] nvdimm: document the nd_uuid_store() input length

Describe the len argument so the function kernel-doc covers every
parameter.

No functional change.

Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5
---
 drivers/nvdimm/core.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/nvdimm/core.c b/drivers/nvdimm/core.c
index 34bd886c04a6d..7144b0227a01b 100644
--- a/drivers/nvdimm/core.c
+++ b/drivers/nvdimm/core.c
@@ -210,6 +210,7 @@ EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(to_nvdimm_bus_dev);
  * @dev: container device for the uuid property
  * @uuid_out: uuid buffer to replace
  * @buf: raw sysfs buffer to parse
+ * @len: length of @buf
  *
  * Enforce that uuids can only be changed while the device is disabled
  * (driver detached)
